  "decisions": [
    "Keep owner colors, three sizes, ChoiceFill finite press/selection motion and legacy RadioGroup horizontal default.",
    "The source-compatible Radios alias defaults to vertical and provides nullable model updates; RadioGroup retains its string callback for compatibility.",
    "Current source setters and option mutations are silent; native change carries value, option and the original Event.",
    "Use named native inputs with visible button proxies to retain owner native button interaction and provide actual form validation/values.",
    "No source ripple/prefix/componentName tuning, Square or Elevated controls are exposed.",
    "Radio indicators are semantic circles, so no arbitrary indicator icon API or picker is introduced."
  ]
